sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant A as Provider
    participant Cache as moka Cache

    Client->>A: status_of(key)
    A->>Cache: get(key)
    Cache-->>A: cache entry
    alt Some(Some(value))
        A-->>Client: Known(value)
    else Some(None)
        A-->>Client: NotOnMx
    else None
        A-->>Client: Unknown
    end
    Note over A: reports only: asks MX nothing<br/>and schedules nothing
